==Battleground==
*8 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Star Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[General GreGory|General GreGories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Oldhorn]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Techn-Old Hyena]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Lowkey]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is possible to rush Lowkey with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]] and [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] by defeating the Star Peng with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]]'s [[Money Up]] Talent. Techn-Old Hyena and Oldhorn can be dealt with Idi:NX and [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard]] thereafter.

==Trivia==
*An oubliette is a dungeon whose only entrance or exit is a trapdoor at the top.

